WEBVTT

00:00:00.890 --> 00:00:04.920
<i>I met Aoyama-kun in grade school.</i>

00:00:05.900 --> 00:00:10.400
<i>Even back then, he was the kind 
of person who caught your eye.</i>

00:00:10.990 --> 00:00:15.360
<i>He possessed a taciturn demeanor 
and an indomitable spirit.</i>

00:00:15.780 --> 00:00:18.760
<i>As a highly timid girl,
I found that intimidating,</i>

00:00:16.490 --> 00:00:18.760
Hey! That's not safe!

00:00:18.760 --> 00:00:21.160
Get back in here! Right this instant!

00:00:18.760 --> 00:00:21.310
<i>and we didn't talk to each other much.</i>

00:00:21.160 --> 00:00:22.330
Come on! Hurry up!

00:00:22.890 --> 00:00:27.740
<i>But I will never forget 
that one time in fifth grade...</i>

00:00:29.340 --> 00:00:32.620
<i>It was the one and only time that 
Aoyama-kun and I had a conversation.</i>

00:00:41.550 --> 00:00:44.640
<i>Aoyama-kun, do you remember?</i>

00:02:16.900 --> 00:02:21.160
<b>#2</b>

00:02:17.190 --> 00:02:21.160
A-o-ya-ma-kun!

00:02:17.300 --> 00:02:21.160
<b>Aoyama-kun, Do You Remember?</b>

00:02:21.750 --> 00:02:24.050
Good work!

00:02:22.690 --> 00:02:24.450
He's so cool!

00:02:27.580 --> 00:02:29.150
Aoyama-kun!

00:02:27.580 --> 00:02:29.620
Damn groupies. They're nearly on the pitch.

00:02:31.290 --> 00:02:33.270
If you're just spectating, 
get out of here already!

00:02:36.850 --> 00:02:40.770
Aoyama, go pick up the balls. 
You're good at cleaning up, right?

00:02:40.770 --> 00:02:41.480
Sure.

00:02:44.150 --> 00:02:46.730
Don't expect me to coddle you.

00:02:54.730 --> 00:02:58.630
He sure is a crafty one. Does he
want to avoid handling balls that badly?

00:03:08.180 --> 00:03:09.660
Nice header.

00:03:09.660 --> 00:03:13.500
Dude! Aoyama, you did that on purpose—

00:03:14.120 --> 00:03:15.140
Damn him.

00:03:16.020 --> 00:03:18.210
But I'm impressed
he got me with that delay!

00:03:22.740 --> 00:03:24.140
I'm so hot.

00:03:24.730 --> 00:03:29.850
So... lately, I keep getting the feeling
that someone's checking me out.

00:03:30.440 --> 00:03:31.720
Don't be ridiculous.

00:03:31.720 --> 00:03:33.810
You're imagining it.

00:03:34.490 --> 00:03:37.820
I guess only guys who have loving gazes
cast on them can understand this.

00:03:38.570 --> 00:03:39.780
Right, Aoyama?

00:03:41.090 --> 00:03:42.740
That sort of thing doesn't interest me.

00:03:43.430 --> 00:03:44.830
It's all in your head.

00:03:44.830 --> 00:03:46.660
Who ever cast a loving gaze on you?

00:03:46.660 --> 00:03:48.700
Nobody cares about you, man.

00:03:49.260 --> 00:03:51.660
I know no one will ever love me!

00:03:52.740 --> 00:03:54.030
Wait up, four eyes.

00:03:54.030 --> 00:03:55.630
Hey, stupid four eyes!

00:04:07.540 --> 00:04:10.140
Fujimi High! Fight! Fight!

00:04:10.140 --> 00:04:11.820
Aoyama-kun!

00:04:13.060 --> 00:04:14.350
Aoyama-kun!

00:04:14.350 --> 00:04:15.980
Aoyama-kun!

00:04:19.900 --> 00:04:22.820
Whoa, it's sparkling clean again today.

00:04:26.410 --> 00:04:30.740
Thanks to Aoyama, the clubhouse is 
looking better than it's ever looked.

00:04:35.690 --> 00:04:38.170
Even my school uniform is neatly folded.

00:04:38.780 --> 00:04:42.470
Hey, Aoyama, did you have to go this far?

00:04:44.690 --> 00:04:47.400
I didn't do that.

00:04:47.400 --> 00:04:48.120
Huh?

00:04:48.770 --> 00:04:51.600
I'd rather die than
touch someone else's clothes.

00:04:51.600 --> 00:04:54.060
Don't look so smug when you say that!

00:04:54.490 --> 00:04:58.200
Besides, my uniform goes to
 the dry cleaners every day!

00:04:58.200 --> 00:05:00.070
What? To the dry cleaners?

00:05:00.070 --> 00:05:01.230
You snob!

00:05:01.230 --> 00:05:03.280
Mine are washed by hand!

00:05:03.940 --> 00:05:06.780
By hand? Wait, are you 
wearing silk or something?

00:05:07.250 --> 00:05:08.240
Of course not!

00:05:08.870 --> 00:05:10.730
As if I'd wear something like that!

00:05:09.090 --> 00:05:13.260
Now that I think about it,
Aoyama was training with us the whole time.

00:05:10.730 --> 00:05:14.980
Man, this is why rich people suck.

00:05:13.260 --> 00:05:14.980
Has someone trespassed in our clubhouse?

00:05:16.710 --> 00:05:19.280
All right, everybody.
Check your valuables, just in case.

00:05:19.280 --> 00:05:21.960
Going forward, we need to make sure
we always lock the clubhouse.

00:05:22.360 --> 00:05:23.970
Yes, sir.

00:05:32.910 --> 00:05:34.310
A doll?

00:05:47.290 --> 00:05:48.820
They got us again.

00:05:48.820 --> 00:05:50.500
But the door was locked!

00:05:52.350 --> 00:05:55.120
Let's just agree that
this is the work of a fairy.

00:05:55.120 --> 00:05:55.780
Okay!

00:05:55.780 --> 00:05:58.750
Are you scared?!
Stop sticking your heads in the sand!

00:06:01.050 --> 00:06:03.420
And that makes it every day this week.

00:06:03.900 --> 00:06:05.670
Thank you, fairy!

00:06:06.190 --> 00:06:07.930
It's folded all nicely again.

00:06:07.930 --> 00:06:10.120
I can feel the love.

00:06:10.120 --> 00:06:12.640
I'm absolutely certain 
that the fairy's into me.

00:06:12.640 --> 00:06:13.480
Huh?

00:06:13.480 --> 00:06:16.310
How did you even arrive 
at that, you moron?

00:06:16.310 --> 00:06:19.600
Mine's folded a tiny bit differently.

00:06:19.600 --> 00:06:21.200
See? More care and attention!

00:06:21.200 --> 00:06:24.060
You wish! Mine was folded
with more care and attention!

00:06:24.060 --> 00:06:27.220
There's nothing uglier than a jealous guy.

00:06:25.450 --> 00:06:26.570
Shut up.

00:06:32.010 --> 00:06:33.070
That's big.

00:06:37.610 --> 00:06:39.310
Hey, gather round!

00:06:39.310 --> 00:06:40.920
Okay.

00:06:40.920 --> 00:06:42.880
Let's do this.

00:07:08.350 --> 00:07:11.240
<i>I wonder what Aoyama-kun's up to...</i>

00:07:31.820 --> 00:07:35.140
U-Um, cats aren't scary...

00:07:36.270 --> 00:07:38.750
Aoyama-kun, do you like cats?

00:07:50.650 --> 00:07:52.600
Um, you can have this.

00:07:53.330 --> 00:07:54.910
I made it.

00:07:55.270 --> 00:07:57.180
Can you touch <i>this</i> cat?

00:07:59.500 --> 00:08:01.750
That cat has a weird face.

00:08:08.350 --> 00:08:09.290
I'll take it.

00:08:12.270 --> 00:08:15.150
But could you give it to me 
after it's been washed?

00:08:17.390 --> 00:08:20.380
<i>Aoyama-kun was a clean freak.</i>

00:08:24.680 --> 00:08:27.900
<i>Back then, I couldn't give him the doll,</i>

00:08:28.460 --> 00:08:30.470
<i>but we're at the same high school now.</i>

00:08:35.780 --> 00:08:39.300
<i>Even though he's now
 totally out of my league,</i>

00:08:43.390 --> 00:08:46.150
<i>I want to cheer him on as much as I can.</i>

00:08:48.050 --> 00:08:48.870
All right.

00:08:51.290 --> 00:08:52.490
Want me to help?

00:08:58.670 --> 00:09:00.100
Why? No! No!

00:09:00.100 --> 00:09:01.580
Why are you here?!

00:09:02.740 --> 00:09:08.330
<i>It's over. He must think I'm a creep 
for breaking in here every day to clean.</i>

00:09:12.190 --> 00:09:14.900
<i>And on top of that, 
all those handmade dolls...</i>

00:09:19.480 --> 00:09:23.270
<i>I should've known he wouldn't remember me!</i>

00:09:35.150 --> 00:09:35.870
This won't do.

00:09:38.680 --> 00:09:39.970
<b>Anti-Bacterial</b>

00:09:38.680 --> 00:09:39.970
Sparkly
 Clean

00:09:40.340 --> 00:09:43.270
If you're cleaning, using this 
will yield perfect results.

00:09:44.460 --> 00:09:45.240
Also...

00:09:47.330 --> 00:09:49.400
I see the weird face hasn't changed at all.

00:09:54.260 --> 00:09:55.690
It's been a while,

00:09:57.640 --> 00:09:58.990
Gotou Moka.

00:10:00.250 --> 00:10:01.560
Aoyama-kun!

00:10:06.340 --> 00:10:10.260
You've got some nerve,
skipping practice to sneak a girl in here!

00:10:10.260 --> 00:10:12.260
And you've made her cry?!

00:10:12.260 --> 00:10:14.210
Um, that's not what happened!

00:10:15.420 --> 00:10:16.870
I see...

00:10:18.250 --> 00:10:21.020
So you're the cleaning fairy.

00:10:23.720 --> 00:10:26.410
We're grateful for all the cleaning,

00:10:26.410 --> 00:10:28.850
but maybe you should've asked first.

00:10:29.780 --> 00:10:33.260
I'm really sorry for cleaning 
your clubhouse without asking.

00:10:33.670 --> 00:10:37.780
But I just wanted to be useful.

00:10:38.270 --> 00:10:40.360
I wanted to make you happy...

00:10:46.670 --> 00:10:48.110
<i>Aoyama-kun.</i>

00:10:49.510 --> 00:10:53.590
<i>I wanted to be useful to you.</i>

00:10:53.590 --> 00:10:56.050
<i>I wanted to make you happy.</i>

00:10:56.590 --> 00:10:58.060
Captain!

00:11:03.320 --> 00:11:05.480
Of course, this is only if you're willing,

00:11:05.480 --> 00:11:08.990
but can we ask you to clean our
 clubhouse in an official capacity?

00:11:10.550 --> 00:11:12.820
As the soccer club's manager, I mean.

00:11:14.890 --> 00:11:18.130
We do have someone here 
who's a total clean freak, after all.

00:11:18.790 --> 00:11:21.360
It'd be a real help to have
someone like you on board.

00:11:24.610 --> 00:11:26.260
I, um...

00:11:28.030 --> 00:11:30.150
I'll do my very best!

00:11:31.290 --> 00:11:33.250
Hooray!

00:11:34.680 --> 00:11:36.120
Woohoo!

00:11:38.200 --> 00:11:39.640
That settles it!

00:11:41.720 --> 00:11:44.180
They're a bunch of weirdos, 
but welcome to our club.

00:11:44.180 --> 00:11:48.140
Woohoo!

00:11:48.140 --> 00:11:52.060
Woohoo!

00:11:55.810 --> 00:11:56.980
That's big.

00:11:58.730 --> 00:12:01.740
<b>I will protect 
Aoyama-kun!</b>

00:11:58.730 --> 00:12:01.740
<b>Gotou Moka</b>

00:12:01.740 --> 00:12:04.740
<b>The team's 
comic relief!</b>

00:12:01.740 --> 00:12:04.740
<b>Sakai Kazuma</b>

00:12:01.740 --> 00:12:04.740
<b>Tsukamoto Jin</b>

00:12:01.740 --> 00:12:04.740
<b>Yoshioka Taichi</b>

00:12:15.460 --> 00:12:16.590
All right.

00:12:20.140 --> 00:12:21.860
Take five!

00:12:22.290 --> 00:12:23.510
I've got water!

00:12:25.190 --> 00:12:26.690
Sweet!

00:12:30.890 --> 00:12:32.460
I'm so tired.

00:12:34.520 --> 00:12:37.360
Aoyama-kun!

00:12:37.670 --> 00:12:40.800
Aoyama's popularity is still ridiculous.

00:12:40.800 --> 00:12:42.890
There weren't even any classes today.

00:12:42.890 --> 00:12:45.320
And recently, the number 
of guys has gone up, too.

00:12:45.640 --> 00:12:49.280
A-o-ya-ma!

00:12:49.670 --> 00:12:51.150
Speaking of Aoyama,

00:12:51.150 --> 00:12:55.580
I heard that he not only takes a shower 
after practice, but before, too.

00:12:55.580 --> 00:12:59.290
In fact, if he spots an opening, 
he'll take one <i>during</i> practice, too.

00:13:00.760 --> 00:13:02.710
That's it for today!

00:13:05.680 --> 00:13:08.380
This is Aoyama's towel, isn't it?

00:13:08.380 --> 00:13:11.640
It's on his locker, so I guess so.

00:13:12.060 --> 00:13:15.140
His towel has his initial on it!

00:13:15.140 --> 00:13:16.490
That's so funny!

00:13:22.100 --> 00:13:25.530
Sure, Aoyama's in the shower right now,
but what do you think you're doing?!

00:13:30.470 --> 00:13:31.760
Just so you know,

00:13:32.860 --> 00:13:34.390
Aoyama's towel...

00:13:40.040 --> 00:13:42.120
...smells super good!

00:13:43.340 --> 00:13:46.570
Stop that, you idiot. It's perverted!

00:13:46.570 --> 00:13:49.210
If you doubt me, give it a sniff! Here!

00:13:49.210 --> 00:13:51.810
Cut it out! Don't lump me in with you!

00:13:53.050 --> 00:13:56.230
What are you doing, you specky degenerate?
We'll leave you behind.

00:13:59.730 --> 00:14:02.690
<b>Aoyama's towel gives off a sweet, 
elegant aroma!! Outrageous</b>

00:14:00.730 --> 00:14:01.790
All right...

00:14:02.690 --> 00:14:07.650
Aoyama's towel gives off a sweet, 
elegant aroma!! Outrageous

00:14:02.690 --> 00:14:07.650
"Aoyama's towel gives off a sweet, 
elegant aroma! Outrageous."

00:14:10.290 --> 00:14:11.920
Take five!

00:14:11.920 --> 00:14:14.510
Afterward, we'll have
a five-on-five mini-game.

00:14:16.740 --> 00:14:18.370
Aoyama-kun, your towel.

00:14:30.410 --> 00:14:31.890
Ow!

00:14:33.010 --> 00:14:35.000
Gotou-chan, can you please disinfect it?

00:14:35.000 --> 00:14:35.850
R-Right away!

00:14:39.180 --> 00:14:41.910
U-Um, I can't stand the sight of blood...

00:14:50.410 --> 00:14:53.000
All right, Sakai-san, all done.

00:14:53.730 --> 00:14:55.660
Oh! Thank you!

00:14:57.620 --> 00:14:58.690
Pass it!

00:15:08.500 --> 00:15:09.980
Hey, four eyes...

00:15:10.880 --> 00:15:14.170
Aoyama's towel <i>does </i>smell super good.

00:15:14.170 --> 00:15:15.500
What did you just say?!

00:15:15.500 --> 00:15:19.630
Its fresh scent conjured up a vision of
translucent blue. Very Aoyama-like.

00:15:19.630 --> 00:15:21.370
See, told you so.

00:15:21.370 --> 00:15:25.320
Friendship

00:15:21.600 --> 00:15:22.500
You sure did.

00:15:22.500 --> 00:15:25.320
What is wrong with you guys?
What kind of pervert does that?!

00:15:25.320 --> 00:15:28.860
It's true. It smelled better than I imagined.

00:15:29.500 --> 00:15:31.080
That's Aoyama for you.

00:15:31.080 --> 00:15:33.450
Even his towel's aroma is alluring.

00:15:34.870 --> 00:15:39.750
<i>D-Did everyone sniff Aoyama's towel but me?</i>

00:15:42.130 --> 00:15:45.710
There's no mistaking it now. 
This team is rotten to the core.

00:15:49.100 --> 00:15:50.460
Wh-What should I do?

00:15:50.460 --> 00:15:53.300
If this keeps up, they'll defile Aoyama-kun.

00:15:53.430 --> 00:15:55.390
I mean, his <i>towels</i>!

00:15:55.970 --> 00:15:57.970
Ready yourself, Moka.

00:15:57.970 --> 00:16:00.640
I have to protect Aoyama-kun.

00:16:00.770 --> 00:16:02.770
I mean, protect his <i>towels</i>.

00:16:15.330 --> 00:16:18.050
Tsukamoto-san,
what do you think you're doing?

00:16:19.480 --> 00:16:23.700
I'm... um... Gotou-chan, what's with the bat?

00:16:23.700 --> 00:16:24.710
I made it myself.

00:16:24.710 --> 00:16:27.240
It looks like it could easily kill someone.

00:16:27.240 --> 00:16:29.580
The flowers and cats are cute, but...

00:16:31.320 --> 00:16:36.330
<i>A quick shift from staunch defense
to front-line offense,</i>

00:16:36.330 --> 00:16:38.140
<i>putting intimidating pressure
 on the opponent...</i>

00:16:38.700 --> 00:16:41.070
<i>Excellent defense, Gotou Moka!</i>

00:16:42.940 --> 00:16:46.560
<i>And that's how I protected 
Aoyama-kun's towels,</i>

00:16:46.560 --> 00:16:51.970
<i>which should have put an end
to the towel shenanigans.</i>

00:16:55.890 --> 00:17:00.020
You know what I heard?
Aoyama-kun's towels smell super amazing.

00:17:00.020 --> 00:17:01.450
Oh, really?

00:17:01.450 --> 00:17:03.440
Tell me more! Is that really true?

00:17:03.440 --> 00:17:04.540
What do they smell of?!

00:17:04.540 --> 00:17:06.700
Aoyama's towels are <i>that </i>good?

00:17:06.700 --> 00:17:08.680
I heard the aroma is like Cupid's Arrow!

00:17:08.680 --> 00:17:11.760
Is it true that just smelling it 
will make your wish come true?!

00:17:11.760 --> 00:17:16.720
<i>The rumor got embellished and
spread like wildfire all over school.</i>

00:17:17.350 --> 00:17:18.850
Wh-What's going on?

00:17:20.590 --> 00:17:22.430
What's happening?!

00:17:22.430 --> 00:17:23.640
This is bad...

00:17:24.270 --> 00:17:26.850
<b>Pure Aoyama fans</b>

00:17:28.340 --> 00:17:29.940
This is part of scouting!

00:17:31.520 --> 00:17:34.780
<b>People Who Showed Up 
Because of the Twisted Rumor</b>

00:17:35.370 --> 00:17:37.480
Die in a fire, popular guy!

00:17:37.480 --> 00:17:38.740
Boyfriend.

00:17:39.240 --> 00:17:41.950
<b>Simply Nosy</b>

00:17:41.950 --> 00:17:44.160
What's going on?

00:17:44.540 --> 00:17:47.620
<b>Cat</b>

00:17:50.940 --> 00:17:51.870
<i>What should I do?</i>

00:17:51.870 --> 00:17:55.550
<i>I can't protect Aoyama-kun all by myself!</i>

00:17:57.320 --> 00:17:58.810
Take five!

00:18:11.400 --> 00:18:14.530
Aoyama's towel!

00:18:16.320 --> 00:18:19.320
Everybody, please stop!

00:18:26.550 --> 00:18:27.880
That's our Aoyama!

00:18:27.880 --> 00:18:31.130
He's ducking and diving 
through that onslaught!

00:18:31.610 --> 00:18:34.590
And for some unknown reason, 
he's also dribbling.

00:18:35.020 --> 00:18:39.250
Amazing! That's amazing, 
but he's a grade-A idiot!

00:18:41.460 --> 00:18:44.510
<i>I-I need to protect Aoyama-kun!</i>

00:18:48.890 --> 00:18:52.780
Towel, towel, towel, towel! 
Enough of that crap!

00:18:56.930 --> 00:19:01.780
What gave you interlopers the idea that
you can set foot on this sacred field?!

00:19:02.550 --> 00:19:04.740
We're serious about soccer!

00:19:07.290 --> 00:19:09.900
If you get in our way,
I won't care if you're a girl or a guy!

00:19:09.900 --> 00:19:12.040
I'll kill you!

00:19:15.460 --> 00:19:18.620
Zaizen doesn't scare me, but his dad...

00:19:18.620 --> 00:19:22.020
Yeah. Draw the ire of the Zaizen family,
and you'll get rubbed out.

00:19:22.020 --> 00:19:22.940
Tch...

00:19:27.160 --> 00:19:29.890
Kaocchi, nice power play.

00:19:34.920 --> 00:19:36.260
Jeez...

00:19:36.260 --> 00:19:40.660
I can't believe all those people are
going bananas over Aoyama's stupid towel.

00:19:40.660 --> 00:19:42.570
What a bunch of idiots.

00:19:45.300 --> 00:19:47.040
I'm not a pervert.

00:19:54.440 --> 00:19:55.400
Dammit!

00:19:58.050 --> 00:19:59.270
<i>I'm...</i>

00:19:59.270 --> 00:20:01.150
It smells super good.

00:20:01.150 --> 00:20:04.070
Its fresh scent conjured up
a vision of translucent blue.

00:20:05.460 --> 00:20:07.560
<i>Aoyama's towel is just...</i>

00:20:07.560 --> 00:20:09.880
It smelled better than I imagined.

00:20:09.880 --> 00:20:11.990
Even his towel's aroma is alluring.

00:20:11.990 --> 00:20:13.020
<i>I'm...</i>

00:20:17.610 --> 00:20:21.260
<i>What is this nostalgic smell, 
so full of kindness?</i>

00:20:40.310 --> 00:20:42.120
It's mommy's smell...

00:20:49.460 --> 00:20:51.220
You're a pervert.

00:20:51.590 --> 00:20:52.210
No!

00:20:52.210 --> 00:20:53.510
I-It's not like that!

00:20:53.510 --> 00:20:54.960
It just triggered some nostalgia!

00:20:54.960 --> 00:20:57.190
P-Please forget you saw anything!

00:20:58.450 --> 00:21:02.050
Zaizen-san, please dispose of that towel.

